## 🎯 Final Checklist Before Launch

1. ✅ All critical paths (browse → add to cart → checkout) tested end‑to‑end.  
2. 🚀 Production build size < 200 KB (excluding vendor libs).  
3. 📱 Responsive across mobile, tablet, desktop.  
4. 🛡️ HTTPS, CSP, HSTS headers set.  
5. 📈 Analytics (Google Analytics, Plausible) integrated.  
6. 📧 Email templates ready for order confirmations.  

Once you hit “✅”, you’re ready to ship! Good luck, and feel free to ping me if you hit a snag along the way.
